  "source_method": "Upstream MFA phone competition gaps using a disposable database copy. Only identical original phone sequences mapped; intervals reset to exact original sample positions before read-only scoring. Scores are nonnegative relative acoustic gaps, not calibrated probabilities or human labels.",
  "calibration": "Per exact stressed source-phone label, require >=20 measured occurrences. q25/q75 use floor(p*(n-1)) order statistics. Penalty=min(60,12*max(0,(gap-q75)/max(1,q75-q25))). Unknown/unmapped/thin classes remain unpenalized; no invented confidence or hard source exclusion. Manual acceptance overrides this derived penalty; manual rejection remains absolute.",
  "weights": "Full phones carry their whole penalty; exposed half phones carry one half. Whole recorded words/phrases apply the existing .35 source-quality weight. No new join, pitch, duration, gain, beam or lexical scoring changes.",
